# 2. PRODUCT VISION

Build a digital academic marketplace where students can discover, purchase and securely view college notes, study materials, handwritten notes, assignments, question banks, laboratory records and examination preparation materials.

Contributors can upload and sell their original academic materials.

Students can purchase access to individual documents or academic packages.

Professors with verified identities can review and evaluate academic materials.

The platform must protect intellectual property using a multi-layer digital rights management system.

CORE PRINCIPLE:

Students purchase permission to view academic documents, NOT unrestricted ownership of downloadable PDF files.

The platform should initially target Indian colleges and universities but its architecture must support international expansion.

